{
    "lesson": 23,
    "title": [
        "It Really Hurts!",
        "真的很疼！"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "An ambulance arrived at the health centre.",
                "一辆救护车到达了健康中心。"
            ],
            [
                "Denis' parents and nurses carried him out of the ambulance.",
                "丹尼斯的父母和护士把他从救护车上抬了下来。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Doctor, please save my boy.",
                "「医生，请救救我的孩子。"
            ],
            [
                "He's in danger now!\" His mum cried.",
                "他现在有危险！」他的妈妈哭喊道。"
            ],
            [
                "\"What's the problem?",
                "「怎么了？"
            ],
            [
                "Could you tell me what happened to your son?",
                "你能告诉我你儿子发生了什么事吗？"
            ],
            [
                "Is it an accident or something happened inside his body?\"",
                "是意外还是身体内部出了问题？」"
            ],
            [
                "\"He first went to the gym and then played football with his friends outdoors.",
                "「他先去了健身房，然后和朋友们在户外踢足球。"
            ],
            [
                "He was hit badly by the flying football and fell down crying 'I have a horrible stomach ache!'\"",
                "他被飞来的足球重重地击中，摔倒在地，哭着说『我肚子疼得厉害！』」"
            ],
            [
                "\"OK, I see.",
                "「好的，我明白了。"
            ],
            [
                "First of all, I'll do some body check.",
                "首先，我会做一些身体检查。"
            ],
            [
                "Body temperature is normal.",
                "体温正常。"
            ],
            [
                "Brain and neck are fine.",
                "大脑和颈部没问题。"
            ],
            [
                "There's no obvious blood in the stomach.",
                "胃里没有明显的出血。"
            ],
            [
                "I think the strong hit caused his stomach a lot of pain.",
                "我认为强烈的撞击导致他的胃很疼。"
            ],
            [
                "I'll give him a prescription(处方).",
                "我会给他开个处方。"
            ],
            [
                "You take him the tablets from the chemist's to relieve his pain and clean the stomach as well.",
                "你去药店给他拿药来缓解疼痛，同时也清理一下胃。"
            ],
            [
                "You should make an appointment in two days to see if he needs any other special treatment.\"",
                "你应该在两天后预约，看看他是否需要其他特殊治疗。」"
            ],
            [
                "\"Thank you so much, Doctor.",
                "「非常感谢，医生。"
            ],
            [
                "We'll look after him carefully in the two days.\" His mum was relieved, and then turned her head to Denis, \"Can you hear me, my boy?\"",
                "我们会在这两天好好照顾他的。」他的妈妈松了一口气，然后转头对丹尼斯说：「孩子，你能听到我说话吗？」"
            ],
            [
                "\"Yes, Mum.\" Denis opened his mouth weakly.",
                "「是的，妈妈。」丹尼斯虚弱地张开嘴。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Oh, my boy.",
                "「哦，我的孩子。"
            ],
            [
                "You are finally awake,\" said his mum excitedly and threw her arms around his neck.",
                "你终于醒了，」他的妈妈兴奋地说，然后搂住他的脖子。"
            ],
            [
                "\"We are all frightened and only hope the hit won't be bad for your stomach and you will be healthy.\"",
                "「我们都很害怕，只希望这次撞击不会对你的胃造成不好的影响，希望你能健康。」"
            ]
        ]
    },
